Package: wordlistctl
Version: 0.9.4
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: python, curl
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/BlackArch/wordlistctl
Description: Fetch, install and search wordlist archives from wordlists and repositories
 wordlistctl searches, fetches and installs wordlist archives from the
 command line. It can search and download wordlists from online
 repositories, install them locally, and keep them updated from repo.json.
